---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | TahaRb"
  description="Privacy Policy for TahaRb."
>

<section class="legal">

  <div class="container narrow">

    <span class="eyebrow">LEGAL</span>

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p class="updated">
      Last updated: August 2026
    </p>

    <h2>Introduction</h2>

    <p>
      Your privacy is important. This Privacy Policy explains
      how information may be collected, used, and protected
      when you visit TahaRb.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

    <p>
      We may collect information that you voluntarily provide,
      such as your name or email address when contacting us.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>

    <p>
      This website may use cookies to improve user experience,
      analyze traffic, and enhance website performance.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

    <p>
      We may use trusted third-party services such as analytics,
      affiliate programs, and embedded content.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <p>
      If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy,
      please visit the Contact page.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

</BaseLayout>